      hu: ["A folyó teljes hossza körülbelül 560 kilométer.", "A vízfolyás az Atlanti-óceánba torkollik Madingo-Kayes-nél.", "A Sounda-szoros 1000 MW-os vízerőművi kapacitással rendelkezik.", "A Niari-völgy a kongói cukoripar központi területe.", "Felső szakaszán Niari, alsó szakaszán Kouilou néven ismert.", "A torkolat Pointe-Noire-tól mintegy 50 km-re északra található."],
      ro: ["Lungimea totală a cursului de apă este de circa 560 km.", "Râul se varsă direct în apele Oceanului Atlantic.", "Cheile Sounda au un potențial hidroenergetic de 1.000 MW.", "Valea Niari este principala regiune agricolă a țării.", "Numele râului se schimbă din Niari în Kouilou spre aval.", "Gura de vărsare se află la nord-vest de orașul Pointe-Noire."],
      en: ["The total length of the river is approximately 560 km.", "The river empties directly into the Atlantic Ocean.", "Sounda Gorge has a hydroelectric potential of 1,000 MW.", "The Niari Valley is the hub of Congo's sugar production.", "It is called Niari upstream and Kouilou in its lower reaches.", "The estuary is located about 50 km northwest of Pointe-Noire."],
